msgctxt "64"
msgid "All right, Rikiya. Where to?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"Aniki, uh... I do wanna go sightseein' and all, but you think\r\n"
"we can grab some grub first? Fighting always puts a hole in\r\n"
"my stomach like none other."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "Heh, sure. You have anything in mind?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "Heck yeah I do! Yakiniku!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"Sure you don't want something a little more... local? You\r\n"
"can get yakiniku whenever you want down in Okinawa."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"Well yeah, but there's this one Korean joint I've been\r\n"
"dyin' to go to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"It's the one they always show on the tube, where all the\r\n"
"celebrities hang out and stuff their faces!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"I heard people even saw the Korean mega-star Il Yu-Jin\r\n"
"chillin' there a few years back!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"That... does sound familiar. I'm not sure if it's the same\r\n"
"place, but I have a restaurant in mind. Let's go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "You're the best, Aniki!"
msgstr ""

